<p>PAANCH IMAMON KA RAHA BAN KE SAHARA ABBAS</p>

<p>FATEMA ZEHRA KA BETA BANU HASHIM KA QAMAR<br />
CHAUDA MASUM KI HAI AANKH KA TARA ABBAS</p>

<p>KOI KYA SAMJHE USE JISKO KAHE AALE NABI<br />
HUM HAIN GAMKHAAR ZAMAAANE KE HAMARA ABBAS</p>

<p>KHUD HI MASHKIZE MEIN ABBAS KE AA JAATI FURAT<br />
USKO KAR DETE AGAR EK ISHARA ABBAS</p>

<p>TERI TURBAT KE JO ZAWWAR HAIN BATLAATE HAIN<br />
ALQAMA PAR HAI TERA AB BHI IJARA ABBAS</p>

<p>SHEH NE ABBAS KO SONPI JO SIPEH SALAARI <br />
HAR ZABAAN PAR HAI FAQAT EK HI NARA ABBAS</p>

<p>WO TO KAHIYE NA MILA IZNE WEGA GHAZI KO<br />
WARNA KIS JUNG MEIN AFWAAJ SE HAARA ABBAS</p>

<p>DE KE MASHKIZA SAKINA SE KAHA SARWAR NE<br />
LAUT KE RUN SE NA AAYEGA TUMHARA ABBAS</p>

<p>HASRATO YAAS SE TAKTE THE HARAM AUR HUSAIN<br />
LE KE MASHKIZA JO MAIDAAN KO SIDHARA ABBAS</p>

<p>RAKH KE SAR ZANU PE ABBAS KA KEHTE THE HUSAIN<br />
SAATH GURBAT MEIN NA YUN CHHODO KHUDARA ABBAS</p>

<p>SAR BAREHNA JO HARAM THE TO SARE NOKE SINA<br />
DEKHTA KAISE BHALA SHARM KA MAARA ABBAS</p>

<p>CHAADAREIN CHHINNE PA YAAD AAYA HAR IK BIBI KO<br />
HAR TAMAACHE PA SAKINA NE PUKARA ABBAS</p>

<p>SIBTE JAFAR HO AZADAR TO KYUN HASHR KI FIKR<br />
HOGA WAAN PEHLE SE MAUJUD HAMARA ABBAS</p>
